# Stage Progress Query
# 研究项目阶段追踪仪表板

```dataview
TABLE project_name, stage, verification_status, ars_mode, updated
FROM "5_学术研究织网/研究项目"
WHERE type = "material-passport"
SORT updated DESC
```

## 阶段分布统计

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  stage AS "Current Stage",
  length(rows) AS "Project Count"
FROM "5_学术研究织网/研究项目"
WHERE type = "material-passport"
GROUP BY stage
```

## 各阶段项目详情

### Research 阶段

```dataview
TABLE project_name, ars_mode, verification_status, created
FROM "5_学术研究织网/研究项目"
WHERE type = "material-passport"
WHERE stage = "1-RESEARCH"
SORT updated DESC
```

### Writing 阶段

```dataview
TABLE project_name, ars_mode, verification_status, created
FROM "5_学术研究织网/研究项目"
WHERE type = "material-passport"
WHERE stage = "2-WRITE"
SORT updated DESC
```

### Review 阶段

```dataview
TABLE project_name, ars_mode, verification_status, created
FROM "5_学术研究织网/研究项目"
WHERE type = "material-passport"
WHERE stage = "3-REVIEW"
SORT updated DESC
```

## 停滞项目检测

```dataview
TABLE project_name, stage, updated
FROM "5_学术研究织网/研究项目"
WHERE type = "material-passport"
WHERE date(updated) < (date(today) - dur(7 days))
SORT updated ASC
```